{
  "title": "The Hunters' Lodge",
  "subtitle": "Range path",
  "icon": "minecraft:bow",
  "group": "skills",
  "order": 7,
  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "lodge_oath",
      "title": "Bow and Oath",
      "text": [
        "Huntmistress Vance won't take a hunter who can't make their own gear. Craft a bow and a quiver's worth of arrows, then swear the lodge oath at the hunters' lodge on the hill west of Reece."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:bow",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:arrow",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "talk": "character",
          "character": "orla",
          "lines": [
            "A bow you made yourself. Good. The lodge has one oath.",
            "Never waste a kill. Say it, and you're one of us."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:lead",
          "name": "Lodge Armband",
          "lore": [
            "Worn by hunters of the lodge."
          ]
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:arrow",
          "count": 16
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 50
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:bow"
    },
    {
      "id": "first_tracks",
      "title": "First Tracks",
      "after": [
        "lodge_oath"
      ],
      "text": [
        "A fletcher shows you how to follow hoof prints through the woods. Track a deer, and take venison and an antler."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "talk": "org",
          "org": "hunters",
          "lines": [
            "Deep at the front: walking, not running. Follow quietly, downwind.",
            "Bring back the venison. The antler's for the lodge wall."
          ]
        },
        {
          "item": "naturalist:venison",
          "count": 2
        },
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "naturalist:deer"
            ],
            "chance": 0.4,
            "item": "naturalist:antler"
          }
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:leather",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 80
        }
      ],
      "icon": "naturalist:antler"
    },
    {
      "id": "target_practice",
      "title": "Bullseye",
      "after": [
        "lodge_oath"
      ],
      "text": [
        "At the lodge's range, put ten arrows into target blocks at longer and longer distances."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:target",
          "count": 3,
          "crafted": true,
          "title": "Make three target blocks"
        },
        {
          "checkmark": "I put ten arrows into the targets"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:arrow",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:iron_ingot",
          "count": 4
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 80
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:target"
    },
    {
      "id": "boar_trouble",
      "title": "Tusks in the Turnips",
      "after": [
        "first_tracks"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Wild boars are tearing up a village's fields. Hunt down the sounder before it ruins the harvest, and keep the bushmeat."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#villages",
          "title": "Reach the troubled village"
        },
        {
          "kill": "naturalist:boar",
          "count": 4,
          "title": "Drive the sounder off the fields",
          "spawn": {
            "at": {
              "structure": "#villages"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "item": "naturalist:bushmeat",
          "count": 3
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "naturalist:cooked_bushmeat",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 120
        }
      ],
      "icon": "naturalist:bushmeat"
    },
    {
      "id": "throwing_steel",
      "title": "Thrown Steel",
      "after": [
        "target_practice"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Old Tobiah swears by thrown weapons, and by never whistling in a forest. Craft iron throwing knives, a tomahawk and javelins, and put them to use."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_throwing_knife",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_tomahawk",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_javelin",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "kill": "minecraft:zombie",
          "count": 6,
          "title": "Make kills with your thrown steel"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:copper_boomerang"
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 150
        }
      ],
      "icon": "spartanweaponry:iron_throwing_knife"
    },
    {
      "id": "firewatch",
      "title": "The Lookout",
      "after": [
        "boar_trouble"
      ],
      "text": [
        "The lodge keeps a lookout in a firewatch tower deep in the forest. Climb it, meet the watcher and mark three game trails from the top."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#firewatch_towers",
          "title": "Climb the firewatch tower"
        },
        {
          "encounter": {
            "entity": "minecraft:villager",
            "name": "Tower Watcher",
            "where": {
              "above_y": 60
            },
            "then": "talk",
            "lines": [
              "Welcome up! Deer east, boar by the stream, something big north.",
              "Mark them. The lodge wants the map."
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "search": {
            "at": {
              "structure": "#firewatch_towers"
            },
            "count": 1,
            "item": {
              "name": "Watcher's Trail Map",
              "tooltip": "Three game trails, inked from the top",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/map"
            },
            "found": "The watcher's old trail map, three game trails inked on it."
          },
          "title": "Take the watcher's trail map from the tower"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:spyglass"
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 150
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:spyglass"
    },
    {
      "id": "longbow",
      "title": "The Longbow",
      "after": [
        "firewatch"
      ],
      "text": [
        "From the tower, the watcher points out a deer far below. Craft a longbow and drop it with one shot from the top, before it wanders off."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_longbow",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "structure": "#firewatch_towers"
        },
        {
          "timed": {
            "seconds": 180,
            "goal": {
              "kill": "naturalist:deer",
              "count": 1
            },
            "lines": [
              "There. Far below. You won't get long.",
              "One good shot."
            ],
            "start": "Take the shot",
            "no": [
              "teleport"
            ]
          },
          "title": "Drop the deer in three minutes"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:arrow",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:spectral_arrow",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 180
        }
      ],
      "icon": "spartanweaponry:iron_longbow"
    },
    {
      "id": "silent_camp",
      "title": "The Silent Camp",
      "after": [
        "firewatch"
      ],
      "text": [
        "A hunting party's camp has gone quiet. Find it, follow the claw marks and rescue the last hunter from the tree where a grizzly bear has kept him for two days."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#camps",
          "title": "Find the silent camp"
        },
        {
          "encounter": {
            "entity": "alexsmobs:grizzly_bear",
            "name": "Camp Grizzly",
            "health": 60,
            "glow": true,
            "then": "kill",
            "lines": [
              "Grrrrr!"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "encounter": {
            "entity": "minecraft:villager",
            "name": "Stranded Hunter",
            "then": "talk",
            "lines": [
              "Is it gone? Two days up this tree! Thank you, friend.",
              "Tell the lodge I'm alive."
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "alexsmobs:bear_fur",
          "count": 2
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 220
        }
      ],
      "icon": "alexsmobs:bear_fur"
    },
    {
      "id": "odd_coats",
      "title": "Odd Coats",
      "after": [
        "throwing_steel"
      ],
      "text": [
        "The lodge collects strange pelts and bones. Bring down odd-looking zombies, spiders and skeletons with arrows, and bring proof of each."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "minecraft:zombie"
            ],
            "chance": 0.15,
            "item": {
              "name": "Odd Hide",
              "tooltip": "Proof for the lodge",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/rotten_flesh"
            }
          },
          "consume": false
        },
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "minecraft:spider"
            ],
            "chance": 0.15,
            "item": {
              "name": "Odd Fang",
              "tooltip": "Proof for the lodge",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/spider_eye"
            }
          },
          "consume": false
        },
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "minecraft:skeleton"
            ],
            "chance": 0.15,
            "item": {
              "name": "Odd Bone",
              "tooltip": "Proof for the lodge",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/bone"
            }
          },
          "consume": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:spectral_arrow",
          "count": 16
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:arrow",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 200
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:spider_eye"
    },
    {
      "id": "heavy_crossbow",
      "title": "Bolts at Night",
      "after": [
        "odd_coats",
        "main_story:act1_start"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Some nights call for a heavier weapon. Craft a heavy crossbow and bolts and drop twenty skeletons before dawn."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_heavy_crossbow",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:bolt",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "kill": "minecraft:skeleton",
          "count": 20,
          "title": "Hold the night: drop twenty skeletons"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:bolt",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 280
        }
      ],
      "icon": "spartanweaponry:iron_heavy_crossbow"
    },
    {
      "id": "superstition",
      "title": "Tobiah's Hat",
      "after": [
        "silent_camp",
        "heavy_crossbow"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Old Tobiah never hunted without his lucky hat, and only passes it to someone who brings him trophies from three different beasts. Luck, he says, follows the hat."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "alexsmobs:moose_antler",
          "title": "Bring a moose's antler"
        },
        {
          "item": "alexsmobs:crocodile_scute",
          "title": "Bring a crocodile's scute"
        },
        {
          "item": "alexsmobs:gazelle_horn",
          "title": "Bring a gazelle's horn"
        },
        {
          "talk": "character",
          "character": "tobiah",
          "lines": [
            "Three beasts, three trophies. The hat is yours.",
            "Left foot first. Always."
          ],
          "title": "Show Tobiah your three trophies"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "artifacts:superstitious_hat"
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 300
        }
      ],
      "icon": "artifacts:superstitious_hat",
      "signature": "artifacts:superstitious_hat"
    },
    {
