      "title": "Coils in the Swamp",
      "after": [
        "superstition"
      ],
      "text": [
        "A villager's boat was dragged under by an anaconda. Hunt it in the swamp and bring back its shed skin for the lodge."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "biome": "minecraft:swamp",
          "title": "Go to the swamp where the boat was lost"
